      "content": "thanks but it doesn't feel like \"taking care of myself\" is the answer. it feels like the more i try to fix things, the more i just make them worse for everyone else. like, my presence is the problem. if i wasn't even here, they could finally just breathe and be happy again without having to worry about me or the mess i made.",
